      "source": "A very loose coupling between a dot path and its (possible) owning type. This is\ndue to the fact that the original PropertyPath does throw an exception on creation\nwhen a property is not found on the entity. Since we are supporting also querying\nfor base classes with properties coming from the inheriting classes, this test on\ncreation is too strict.",
      "translation": "点路径与其（可能的）所属类型之间的耦合非常松散。这是因为原始的 PropertyPath 在创建时，如果实体上找不到对应的属性就会抛出异常。由于我们现在也支持查询基类，且属性可能来自继承类，因此这种在创建时的检查过于严格。",
      "count": 1
    },
